{{DISPLAYTITLE:FediFeeds}}
FediFeeds is a MediaWiki extension that lets people on the Fediverse follow one narrow feed of a wiki, such as the new posts of a blog kept in a category, instead of a single account that announces every edit.

Each feed is its own account. A Mastodon user follows <code>category_4521@femiwiki.com</code> the way they follow a person, and sees a post whenever a page is created in that category.

Nothing is implemented yet. The [[Accounts|spec]] comes first, and any part of it may change.

